#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/index.rst:4
#: 1c1a844630e74e8eb94cc3dd4f17f2d6
msgid ""
"``food3d_im`` estimates the volume of food above an oven tray from"
" two kinds of point cloud: one or more empty-tray frames and a frame "
"containing food. The camera and tray must stay in the same coordinate frame "
"between captures. The result is a height integral in cubic centimetres, "
"accompanied by coverage and hole-filling diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"``food3d_im`` "
"根据空烤盘点云和食材点云估算食材高出烤盘的体积。空盘可拍摄一帧或多帧；两次采集之间，相机与烤盘必须保持在同一坐标系。结果以立方厘米表示，并附带覆盖情况和补洞数量，方便判断哪些部分来自观测。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/index.rst:9
#: b7ba9020f0594a8bb9153c6f5f6027df
msgid ""
"Start with :doc:`measurement <export>` for a complete C++ example. Read "
":doc:`building <components/conan>` if you need to build the package. Doxygen"
" provides the API reference for ``FoodVolumeMeasurer``, "
"``MeasurementConfig``, and ``VolumeEstimate``. After a local documentation "
"build, open ``docs/doxygen/build/docs.html`` to choose a language."
msgstr ""
"先读 :doc:`测量一帧点云 <export>`，其中有完整的 C++ 示例。需要编译包时看 :doc:`使用 Conan 构建 "
"<components/conan>`。``FoodVolumeMeasurer``、``MeasurementConfig`` 和 "
"``VolumeEstimate`` 的接口说明由 Doxygen 生成。本地构建文档后，打开 "
"``docs/doxygen/build/docs.html`` 可选择语言。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/index.rst:15
#: f91cc30356754b0d81c6a267159368a6
msgid "What the estimate means"
msgstr "体积结果的含义"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/index.rst:17
#: 46a937fadede4d3ea5941cd652b0d1fa
msgid ""
"The library fits a plane to the empty tray, stores the observed tray height "
"in each grid cell, and compares food points with that measured surface. It "
"never substitutes an ideal flat tray for cells where the empty capture has "
"no data. Small enclosed gaps in the food surface may be filled; their volume"
" is reported separately from the volume supported by measured points."
msgstr "库从空烤盘点云拟合平面，并在每个栅格保存实测烤盘高度，再与食材点比较。空盘没有数据的栅格不会用理想平面补齐。食材表面内部的小孔洞可能被补全；这部分体积与实测点支撑的体积分开报告。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/index.rst:22
#: e37a49bdbea74ffeaa7be9907e345e14
msgid ""
"Check ``VolumeEstimate.status`` before using any numeric result. On success,"
" ``volume_cm3`` is the sum of ``raw_volume_cm3`` and "
"``interpolated_volume_cm3``. A large ``interpolated_cells`` count or a low "
"``coverage_ratio`` is a reason to inspect the input clouds and the "
"intermediate PCD files, not a reason to treat the estimate as ground truth."
msgstr ""
"使用数值结果前，先检查 ``VolumeEstimate.status``。测量成功时，``volume_cm3`` 等于 "
"``raw_volume_cm3`` 与 ``interpolated_volume_cm3`` 之和。如果 "
"``interpolated_cells`` 很多，或 ``coverage_ratio`` 很低，应检查输入点云和中间 "
"PCD；不要直接把估算值当作实测真值。"

